<TD class="left border-right-single"/>
<TD class="left border-right-single">(d) Sec. 9(b)-(d), 33 U.S.C. 909(b)-(d), provide for the payment of death benefits and the amount of such payments varies in part according to whether the deceased employee has a child or children</TD>
